      "message": "@nkapron@google.com\n\nThanks for the explanation.\n\nThere is no pressing reason for these, and I understand the history of FROMGIT patches causing issues and extra work down the line. \n\nI will wait for these to land upstream first. I\u0027ll abandon these CLs for now.",
      "parentUuid": "7a5d8610_bce1c309",
      "revId": "ac5ac498aa1142b25651f2212f27fe092c1a6189",
